{
  "_comment": [
    "State-delta -> price-shock (GDD 5.5). The balance surface of the entire",
    "game: this is where a designer tunes how hard a famine hits grain, and it",
    "must never become Rust constants.",
    "",
    "The exchange prices NUMBERS, never prose. Every rule keys on a typed field",
    "move between consecutive world views, not on a chronicle line.",
    "",
    "Each rule matches a field move and yields a shock as a FRACTION of price:",
    "  field   - a world::fundamentals::Field key. Unknown keys are a load error.",
    "  class   - the instrument class the shock lands on.",
    "  via     - whose move it is, relative to the listing being shocked:",
    "              self   (default) the listing's own entity moved",
    "              parent the listing is the moved entity's parent  (a node's",
    "                     status reaching the commodity above it)",
    "              child  the listing is a child of the moved entity (a region's",
    "                     famine reaching the towns inside it)",
    "  per_unit- scalar moves: shock per unit of change, clamped to +/- cap.",
    "            Positive means the price moves WITH the field.",
    "  when    - flag/status moves: the reading that fires the rule ('true' /",
    "            'false', or the world's own variant name like 'WarTorn').",
    "  shock   - flag/status moves: the flat shock when it fires.",
    "",
    "Levels belong in instruments.json and reach price as drift; this file is",
    "only for the jolt. A node depleting appears in BOTH — as a shock here and",
    "as a lower nodes_producing there — on purpose: the jolt is immediate, the",
    "revaluation is permanent."
  ],
  "total_cap": 0.45,
  "rules": [
    { "field": "prosperity", "class": "regional_bond", "per_unit": 0.010, "cap": 0.30 },
    { "field": "harvest", "class": "regional_bond", "per_unit": 0.006, "cap": 0.25 },
    { "field": "chaos", "class": "regional_bond", "per_unit": -0.006, "cap": 0.25 },
    { "field": "danger", "class": "regional_bond", "per_unit": -0.004, "cap": 0.20 },
    { "field": "strife", "class": "regional_bond", "per_unit": -0.005, "cap": 0.25 },
    { "field": "population", "class": "regional_bond", "per_unit": 0.00002, "cap": 0.15 },
    { "field": "lore", "class": "regional_bond", "per_unit": 0.002, "cap": 0.10 },
    { "field": "famine", "class": "regional_bond", "when": "true", "shock": -0.20 },
    { "field": "famine", "class": "regional_bond", "when": "false", "shock": 0.12 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "regional_bond", "when": "WarTorn", "shock": -0.22 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "regional_bond", "when": "Struggling", "shock": -0.10 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "regional_bond", "when": "Unrest", "shock": -0.05 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "regional_bond", "when": "Peaceful", "shock": 0.02 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "regional_bond", "when": "Prospering", "shock": 0.04 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "regional_bond", "when": "Thriving", "shock": 0.08 },
    { "field": "population", "class": "regional_bond", "via": "parent", "per_unit": 0.000005, "cap": 0.05 },

    { "field": "population", "class": "settlement_share", "per_unit": 0.00004, "cap": 0.25 },
    { "field": "prosperity", "class": "settlement_share", "per_unit": 0.008, "cap": 0.25 },
    { "field": "famine", "class": "settlement_share", "via": "child", "when": "true", "shock": -0.15 },
    { "field": "famine", "class": "settlement_share", "via": "child", "when": "false", "shock": 0.08 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "settlement_share", "via": "child", "when": "WarTorn", "shock": -0.18 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "settlement_share", "via": "child", "when": "Thriving", "shock": 0.06 },
    { "field": "chaos", "class": "settlement_share", "via": "child", "per_unit": -0.004, "cap": 0.20 },

    { "field": "volume", "class": "route_toll", "per_unit": 0.35, "cap": 0.30 },

    { "field": "node_status", "class": "commodity", "via": "parent", "when": "Depleted", "shock": 0.10 },
    { "field": "node_status", "class": "commodity", "via": "parent", "when": "Contested", "shock": 0.06 },
    { "field": "node_status", "class": "commodity", "via": "parent", "when": "Corrupted", "shock": 0.05 },
    { "field": "node_status", "class": "commodity", "via": "parent", "when": "Unstable", "shock": 0.03 },
    { "field": "node_status", "class": "commodity", "via": "parent", "when": "Overworked", "shock": 0.02 },
    { "field": "node_status", "class": "commodity", "via": "parent", "when": "Active", "shock": -0.02 },
    { "field": "node_status", "class": "commodity", "via": "parent", "when": "Blessed", "shock": -0.05 },
    { "field": "node_status", "class": "commodity", "via": "parent", "when": "Flourishing", "shock": -0.06 },

    { "field": "prestige", "class": "house_scrip", "per_unit": 0.0015, "cap": 0.30 },
    { "field": "living_renown", "class": "house_scrip", "per_unit": 0.0002, "cap": 0.35 },
    { "field": "living_members", "class": "house_scrip", "per_unit": 0.05, "cap": 0.30 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "house_scrip", "via": "child", "when": "WarTorn", "shock": -0.10 },

    { "field": "prestige", "class": "order_charter", "per_unit": 0.002, "cap": 0.25 },
    { "field": "living_renown", "class": "order_charter", "per_unit": 0.00005, "cap": 0.25 },
    { "field": "living_members", "class": "order_charter", "per_unit": 0.02, "cap": 0.25 },

    { "field": "power", "class": "relic_lot", "per_unit": 0.10, "cap": 0.30 },
    { "field": "instability", "class": "relic_lot", "per_unit": -0.004, "cap": 0.20 },
    { "field": "status", "class": "relic_lot", "via": "child", "when": "WarTorn", "shock": -0.08 }
  ]
}
